skate (working title)

Code, parks, trick names and the four skaters: original to this repository (MIT, see LICENSE).

- The skaters are made by tools/chars/make-skaters.mjs, the character generator of the brawler example in
  more-cartwheel-examples (our own code, MIT), copied here with four skaters' proportions and outfits.
- The ragdolls (src/rag.c) follow the brawler example's.
- The riders' posing (src/pose.c) takes its angles and timings from published skateboarding studies and coaching
  guides, and from joint angles measured in the CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database's skateboarding takes
  (mocap.cs.cmu.edu, subject 134; free for all uses). No motion data is copied into the game.
- The procedural texture pipeline (src/gfx.c) follows the arena and derby examples' (our own code, MIT).
- Built on cartwheel-engine and three.c (MIT); Box3D (MIT) moves the ragdolls.

No sampled audio, image or model files from anywhere else: every texture and sound is made in code at load.
